        customers: ["**Maruti Suzuki**, 60% of sales and a promoter shareholder; JTEKT supplies about 100% of steering on most Maruti models, and full systems on the e-Vitara, Victoris and a coming electric MPV.", "**Toyota Kirloskar** (10%, nearly 100% share), and **Mahindra, Tata and Honda**; Honda's volumes fell about a third.", "**Exports**: Brazil (a Stellantis platform through JTEKT Brazil) from May 2026, 70,000 units expected in FY27; the US order was hit by tariffs."],
